# What `just web` copies from assets/ into dist/assets/: the files the browser
# fetches over HTTP through Bevy's asset server. The registries and layouts
# the game reads through its file port travel in data.bundle.gz instead
# (tools/xtask `read_by_port`), so they are not copied twice.
- *.bak
+ */
+ *.wgsl
+ *.ttf
+ *.ogg
+ *.glb
+ *.png
+ /themes/veyra.theme.ron
- *
